<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Events%20h" title="Events h">Events_h</a> contains several comment relating to event type literals
</p>
<ul><li> 1015 is used by ambient ai</li>
